        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "These are artificially laboratory-produced molecules that enhance the immune system’s ability to fight against pathogens. Monoclonal antibodies target specific antigens, making them effective for treating cancer, autoimmune disorders, and infectious diseases."
          }
        ]
